     elements in its template — and elements created at runtime never get that
     attribute, so scoped rules simply do not reach them. The suggestion rows,
     the tag chips and the photo thumbnails are all created in the script below,
     which is why they render unstyled unless their rules live out here. The
     `me__` prefix is what keeps that safe. -->
